+in the client, and are VALIDATED against cl.items every frame: anything the
+player does not actually own is dropped out of its slot. That one rule gives the
+whole policy for free — contents survive level transitions and save/load inside
+a session (cl.items survives both), and death, a new game or a start-map
+disarming reset them to empty because the inventory itself resets. Nothing is
+serialised, so no save written by this build is unreadable by any other, and a
+save from R3 or from the 2D iOS app loads with empty holsters rather than wrong
+ones.
