+Immersive v2: the held weapon flick-cycles through what you OWN and are not
+already carrying — anything in a holster or in the other hand is skipped, so a
+flick can never conjure a second copy of the shotgun you are holding, and never
+lands on the rocket launcher that is visibly sitting on your hip.
